OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigating hoax threat
OL,4,Aemails sent to Scottish schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating after a number
OL,7,Fof schools across Scotland were
OL,8,Ftargeted by a bomb threat email which
OL,9,Fis being treated as a hoax.
OL,11,FBBC Scotland has confirmed that
OL,12,Fmessages were received by schools in
OL,13,FGlasgow, Edinburgh, East Renfrewshire,
OL,14,FPerth an Kinross and East Lothian among
OL,15,Fother local authorities.
OL,17,FThey are believed to have been sent to
OL,18,Fboth primary and secondary schools.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
