OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigating hoax threat
OL,4,Aemails sent to Scottish schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchools in Northern Ireland were also
OL,7,Fsent an email claiming "an explosive
OL,8,Fdevice" had been put into 160 schools.
OL,9,FTheir education minister said it was
OL,10,Fnot being treated as a "viable threat".
